  \"magicNumber\" -- PCAP magic number \"majorVersion\"   -- PCAP file major version number \"minorVersion\" -- PCAP minor version number \"thisZone\" -- PCAP time zone (GMT to local correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":236813,"global_rank":89376},{"name":"Chris-Johnston/cameratool","owner":"Chris-Johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/Chris-Johnston/cameratool","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Small tool to test camera shutter speeds","topics":[],"score":236800,"global_rank":89406},{"name":"TseChapman/MultiplayerBlackjack","owner":"TseChapman","html_url":"https://github.com/TseChapman/MultiplayerBlackjack","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":236797,"global_rank":89430},{"name":"frankseide/NutButtonArduino","owner":"frankseide","html_url":"https://github.com/frankseide/NutButtonArduino","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"simple Arduino project to play a sound through sigma-delta coding (no analog amplifier needed)","topics":[],"score":236790,"global_rank":89441},{"name":"kavidey/e80","owner":"kavidey","html_url":"https://github.com/kavidey/e80","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Team 36 lab and robot code for E80-SP24","topics":[],"score":236787,"global_rank":89463},{"name":